{"id":"40699403f178dfd3","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-boundedness-pcf.md","title":"Boundedness in pcf","display":"thm-boundedness-pcf — Boundedness in pcf","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-boundedness-pcf","aliases":["58-thm-boundedness-pcf"],"display":"thm-boundedness-pcf — Boundedness in pcf","depends_on":["[[58-df-singular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-boundedness-pcf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-boundedness-pcf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-boundedness-pcf — Boundedness in pcf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7624782e2090b42\" href=\"?note=c7624782e2090b42\" title=\"58-df-singular-cardinal\">58-df-singular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\kappa,P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa}\\in V\">\\(\\lambda,\\kappa,P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Singular}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Singular}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7624782e2090b42\" href=\"?note=c7624782e2090b42\" title=\"58-df-singular-cardinal\">58-df-singular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}:V\\to V\\)</span> (guarded ordinal cofinality; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> are the set-function and equinumerosity predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}small\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S(a,\\lambda,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\na\\subseteq\\lambda\\land\n\\exists\\nu\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(a,\\nu)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}small\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S(a,\\lambda,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\na\\subseteq\\lambda\\land\n\\exists\\nu\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(a,\\nu)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}small\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family}\\vdash\nP_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa}=\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(\\lambda):\n\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S(a,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}small\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family}\\vdash\nP_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa}=\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(\\lambda):\n\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S(a,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boundedness\\text{-}pcf}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\operatorname{Singular}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\ \\exists!\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mu,P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa}\\;\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\mu\\;(a\\subseteq f(\\xi))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\nu\\in\\mu\\;\\neg\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\nu,P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa})\n\\land\\forall a\\in P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa}\\;\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\nu\\;(a\\subseteq g(\\xi))\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boundedness\\text{-}pcf}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\operatorname{Singular}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\ \\exists!\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mu,P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa}\\;\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\mu\\;(a\\subseteq f(\\xi))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\nu\\in\\mu\\;\\neg\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\nu,P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa})\n\\land\\forall a\\in P_{\\lambda,&lt;\\kappa}\\;\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\nu\\;(a\\subseteq g(\\xi))\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The assertion now states the actual least-cardinal property of the inclusion poset; it does not overload the ordinal cofinality symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> with an undeclared two-place ordered-set operator.</li>\n<li>The singular-cardinal assumptions are retained because this is the pcf instance in which the invariant is subsequently used.</li>\n<li>The carrier of the inclusion poset is now introduced by an object-level set equation, and every member is bounded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\lambda)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-singular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"c7624782e2090b42","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-singular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-singular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"c7624782e2090b42","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Singular}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-singular-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}:V\\to V$ (guarded ordinal cofinality; see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda,\\kappa,P_{\\lambda,<\\kappa}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Singular}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}small\\text{-}subset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S(a,\\lambda,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\na\\subseteq\\lambda\\land\n\\exists\\nu\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(a,\\nu)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}small\\text{-}subset\\text{-}family}\\vdash\nP_{\\lambda,<\\kappa}=\\{a\\in\\mathcal P(\\lambda):\n\\mathrm{PcfSmallSubset}_S(a,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boundedness\\text{-}pcf}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\operatorname{Singular}(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\\\\\n\\to{}&\\ \\exists!\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\n\\land\\exists f\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mu,P_{\\lambda,<\\kappa})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in P_{\\lambda,<\\kappa}\\;\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\mu\\;(a\\subseteq f(\\xi))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\nu\\in\\mu\\;\\neg\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\nu,P_{\\lambda,<\\kappa})\n\\land\\forall a\\in P_{\\lambda,<\\kappa}\\;\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\nu\\;(a\\subseteq g(\\xi))\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\lambda)","display":false}],"bytes":2454,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4057","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-boundedness-pcf.md|58-thm-boundedness-pcf]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["c7624782e2090b42","5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc","36d7463d215be751","28c79fde9f892bfe"]}